flowchart TD
  A[Packet / frame with PTS] --> B[Ingest camera_id + stream_epoch]
  B --> C{Sampling decision}
  C -->|stale / over budget| D[Drop with metric]
  C -->|accepted| E[Bounded inference queue]
  E --> F[Vehicle detection]
  F --> G[ByteTrack per camera]
  G --> H[Quality-ranked vehicle crops]
  H --> I[Plate detection and mask]
  I --> J[OCR and five-frame voting]
  J --> K{ANPR quality}
  K -->|strong| L[ANPR identity]
  K -->|partial / none| M[Conditional P6 track embedding]
  M --> N[Temporal and optional route feasibility]
  L --> O[Deterministic fusion and safeguards]
  N --> O
  O --> P[Alert / review / reject explanation]
  P --> Q[Event store, audit, WebSocket]
